      {
        "brands": ["Two Thin Coats (Duncan Rhodes)"],
        "range": "Dark Arts",
        "detail": "Names and the acrylic, metallic and ink split from Paint Vault's Dark Arts listing (paint-vault.com/brand/two-thin-coats/dark-arts), as found in November 2026. One review names a metallic 'Ancient Brass' where Paint Vault has 'Ancient Iron'."
      },
      {
        "brands": ["Dirty Down"],
        "range": "Effects, Ageing Spray",
        "detail": "Names from retailer and manufacturer listings found by web search in November 2026 (dirtydown.co.uk product pages for the water-soluble rust paints and the ageing spray range; retailers for Moss, Verdigris, Gore and Snot). Effects are 25ml pots; Ageing Spray is 400ml aerosols. No colours are published, and the products are semi-transparent effects. The Snot & Gore thinner is left out."
      }
    ]
  },
